#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:1
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_WelcomeToBattleTent"
msgid ""
"I welcome you to the BATTLE TENT\n"
"FALLARBOR SITE!\p"
"I am your guide to the Set KO Tourney!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:6
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_TakeChallenge"
msgid ""
"Now, do you wish to take the challenge\n"
"of a Set KO Tourney?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:10
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_AwaitAnotherChallenge"
msgid ""
"We await your challenge on\n"
"another occasion!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:14
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainFallarborTent"
msgid ""
"In the FALLARBOR BATTLE TENT,\n"
"we undertake the Set KO Tourney.\p"
"All participants enter with a team of\n"
"three POKéMON.\p"
"The three POKéMON must be lined up\n"
"in the order that they are to appear in.\p"
"During battle, the POKéMON will appear\n"
"one at a time in the preset order.\p"
"Once a POKéMON enters battle, it must\n"
"remain out until the match is decided.\p"
"If a match remains undecided in\n"
"three turns, it goes to judging.\p"
"If you wish to interrupt your challenge,\n"
"please save the game.\p"
"If you don't save, you will not be able\n"
"to continue with your challenge.\p"
"If you pull off the feat of beating\n"
"three TRAINERS in succession,\l"
"we will present you with a fine prize.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:35
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_SaveBeforeChallenge"
msgid ""
"Before showing you to the BATTLE\n"
"TENT, I must save. Is that okay?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:40
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_WhichLevelMode"
msgid ""
"We offer two levels of challenge,\n"
"Level 50 and Open Level.\l"
"Which is your choice?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:45
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_SelectThreeMons"
msgid ""
"Very well, now select your\n"
"three POKéMON, please.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:49
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLv50"
msgid ""
"My dear challenger!\p"
"You do not have the three POKéMON\n"
"required for entry.\p"
"They also must not hold the same\n"
"kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1} ineligible.\p"
"When you have made your preparations,\n"
"please do return.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:59
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen"
msgid ""
"My dear challenger!\p"
"You do not have the three POKéMON\n"
"required for entry.\p"
"To qualify, you must bring three\n"
"different kinds of POKéMON.\p"
"They also must not hold the same\n"
"kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1} ineligible.\p"
"When you have made your preparations,\n"
"please do return.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:71
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_GuideYouToBattleTent"
msgid ""
"I shall now guide you to\n"
"the BATTLE TENT.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:75
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_DidntSaveBeforeQuitting"
msgid ""
"My dear challenger!\p"
"You did not save the game before\n"
"shutting down, did you?\p"
"It is unfortunate, but that has\n"
"resulted in your disqualification\l"
"from your challenge.\p"
"You may, of course, start with a fresh\n"
"challenge.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:85
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_BeatThreeTrainers"
msgid ""
"How splendid! You have beaten\n"
"three TRAINERS in succession!$"
msgstr ""

