msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_RulesAreListed"
msgid "The Battle Swap rules are listed.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:318
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ReadWhichHeading"
msgid "Which heading do you want to read?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:321
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainBasicRules"
msgid ""
"In a Battle Swap event, you may use\n"
"only three POKéMON.\p"
"Whether you are renting or swapping,\n"
"your team may not have two or more\l"
"of the same POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:328
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainSwapPartnerRules"
msgid ""
"You may swap POKéMON only with\n"
"the TRAINER you have just defeated.\p"
"You may swap for only those POKéMON\n"
"used by the beaten TRAINER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:334
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainSwapNumberRules"
msgid ""
"After every battle you win, you may\n"
"swap for one of your defeated\l"
"opponent's POKéMON.\p"
"You will not be able to swap POKéMON\n"
"with the third TRAINER in the event.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:341
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainSwapNotes"
msgid ""
"There are two key points to be aware\n"
"of when swapping POKéMON.\p"
"First, when swapping, you can't check\n"
"the stats of the POKéMON you are\l"
"about to receive.\p"
"Second, the POKéMON on your team\n"
"are lined up in sequence, depending on\l"
"the order in which you rented them.\p"
"This sequence remains unchanged\n"
"even when swaps are made.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:353
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainMonRules"
msgid ""
"The POKéMON of the SLATEPORT\n"
"BATTLE TENT are all rentals.\p"
"All rental POKéMON are kept at\n"
"Level 30.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:360
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_RulesAreListed2"
msgid ""
"The VERDANTURF BATTLE TENT\n"
"rules are listed.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:365
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ReadWhichHeading"
msgid "Which heading do you want to read?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:369
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainBasicRules"
msgid ""
"Here at the VERDANTURF BATTLE TENT,\n"
"POKéMON are required to think and\l"
"battle by themselves.\p"
"Unlike in the wild, POKéMON that live\n"
"with people behave differently\l"
"depending on their nature.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:378
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainNatureRules"
msgid ""
"Depending on its nature, a POKéMON\n"
"may prefer to attack no matter what.\p"
"Another POKéMON may prefer to protect\n"
"itself from any harm.\p"
"Yet another may enjoy vexing or\n"
"confounding its foes.\p"
"Depending on its nature, a POKéMON\n"
"will have favorite moves that it is good\l"
"at using.\p"
"It may also dislike certain moves that\n"
"it has trouble using.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:392
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainMoveRules"
msgid ""
"There are offensive moves that inflict\n"
"direct damage on the foe.\p"
"There are defensive moves that are\n"
"used to prepare for enemy attacks or\l"
"used to heal HP and so on.\p"
"There are also other somewhat-odd\n"
"moves that may enfeeble the foes with\l"
"stat problems including poison and \l"
"paralysis.\p"
"POKéMON will consider using moves in\n"
"these three categories.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:406
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainUnderpoweredRules"
msgid ""
"When not under command by its TRAINER,\n"
"a POKéMON may be unable to effectively\l"
"use certain moves.\p"
"A POKéMON is not good at using any\n"
"move that it dislikes.\p"
"If a POKéMON only knows moves that\n"
"do not match its nature, it will often\l"
"be unable to live up to its potential.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:417
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainWhenInDangerRules"
msgid ""
"Depending on its nature, a POKéMON may\n"
"start using moves that don't match its\l"
"nature when it is in trouble.\p"
"If a POKéMON begins behaving oddly\n"
"in a pinch, watch it carefully.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:424
msgctxt "BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainLevelRules"
msgid ""
"At this BATTLE TENT, the levels of\n"
"your opponents will be adjusted to\l"
"match the levels of your POKéMON.\p"
"However, no TRAINER you face will\n"
"have any POKéMON below Level 30.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:431
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_RulesAreListed"
msgid ""
"The VERDANTURF BATTLE TENT\n"
"rules are listed.$"
msgstr ""
